flowchart LR
  S[Sender-controlled output bytes] --> N[Node: height and version rules plus spend validity]
  N --> C[Chain: committed transaction version]
  C --> G[Wallet: deterministic version dispatch]
  G -->|new version| V[Strict current-v2 attempt]
  G -->|historical version| L[Historical bounded compatibility]
  V --> O[AEAD and spend ownership checks]
  L --> O
  V -->|miss: no fallback| D[No credit]
  O -->|owned| R[Recognized wallet receipt]
  O -->|not owned or invalid| D
